{
 "id": "theme-nade-soul",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/theme-nade-soul",
 "offset_seconds": -3.9200000000001722,
 "words_heard": 227,
 "words": 236,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I kept a ledger in my head of every wrong and right",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Counting up my better days and lying awake at night",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thought that I could earn a place if I just tried some more",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pay a debt I couldn't pay and knock on heaven's door",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God, who is rich in mercy, found me dead in all my sin",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because of the great love he had, he made me live again",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He made me alive together with Christ, though I had nothing to bring",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And raised me up and seated me with him beside the King",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By grace you have been saved through faith",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And this is not from yourselves",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is the gift of God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not from works, so that no one may boast",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a thorn I've carried and I begged him, take it away",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three times I pleaded with the Lord, three times I knelt to pray",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he did not remove it, and he gave a better word",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The truest answer to a prayer that I have ever heard",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My grace is enough for you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For my power is brought to its fullness in weakness",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I am weak, then I am strong",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By grace you have been saved through faith",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And this is not from yourselves",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is the gift of God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not from works, so that no one may boast",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is the gift of God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
